{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775860/extras/979b0448e6fea18ceae0762f67bd1784.poster.avif?t=1765297285\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775860/extras/979b0448e6fea18ceae0762f67bd1784.webm?t=1765297285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775860/extras/979b0448e6fea18ceae0762f67bd1784.mp4?t=1765297285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time to Wizard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an all-powerful Wizard in this turn-based party game! Craft unique spells from elemental cards and battle against up top 3 other wizards. Master deep elemental synergies for strategic destruction or embrace wild magic for over-the-top chaos. Fast-paced duels and the luck of the draw ensure no two battles are ever alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775860/extras/553b31cb4d4b97154a5f63833be29721.poster.avif?t=1765297285\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775860/extras/553b31cb4d4b97154a5f63833be29721.webm?t=1765297285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775860/extras/553b31cb4d4b97154a5f63833be29721.mp4?t=1765297285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round you will be dealt a hand of elemental cards. You will have a short period of time to select three elements with which to craft your spell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each element has a basic effect based on where you place it, but if there is a <strong>Wild </strong>element in the primary position, you cast a <strong>Wild Spell</strong> that will have crazy and game shattering effects. Just beware your <strong>Wild Spell</strong> doesn't annihilate you as well...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last Wizard standing is the winner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775860/extras/d891a074fa75bb4c2d0cd00842642d3b.poster.avif?t=1765297285\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775860/extras/d891a074fa75bb4c2d0cd00842642d3b.webm?t=1765297285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775860/extras/d891a074fa75bb4c2d0cd00842642d3b.mp4?t=1765297285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why you'll love Wild Wizard War</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging multiplayer online experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced and engaging battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple gameplay loop with a high skill ceiling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against friends, strangers or AI bent on your destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new Wizard towers to show off your status</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different Wizards to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique biomes that change your playstyle</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775860?t=1765297285","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775860/094548a7f151cc502ce2de5a05ab16c7bc65f498/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765297285","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775860/f14753f61c94504ce1384163d70674619ecc64c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765297285","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775860/f14753f61c94504ce1384163d70674619ecc64c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765297285","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775860/extras/979b0448e6fea18ceae0762f67bd1784.poster.avif?t=1765297285\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775860/extras/979b0448e6fea18ceae0762f67bd1784.webm?t=1765297285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775860/extras/979b0448e6fea18ceae0762f67bd1784.mp4?t=1765297285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time to Wizard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an all-powerful Wizard in this turn-based party game! Craft unique spells from elemental cards and battle against up top 3 other wizards. Master deep elemental synergies for strategic destruction or embrace wild magic for over-the-top chaos. Fast-paced duels and the luck of the draw ensure no two battles are ever alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775860/extras/553b31cb4d4b97154a5f63833be2972